      "note": "Both defects that held this subsystem at known-defective are fixed. The dynamic procedure now forms the model tensor from the test filter of |S|S_ij, applies the deviatoric projection, and averages the Germano contractions over a selectable set; the constant model reads its coefficient from configuration every step and allocates no coefficient field. Status is experimental rather than supported because no reference-flow validation has been run: decaying isotropic turbulence with homogeneous averaging, where Cs(t) should settle near 0.16-0.17, is the check that would close the gap."
